The first business table of the Enterprise Financial Data Platform was created.

```sql
CREATE TABLE CUSTOMERS (
    CUSTOMER_ID NUMBER GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,
    CUSTOMER_NUMBER VARCHAR2(30) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    FIRST_NAME VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,
    LAST_NAME VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,
    EMAIL VARCHAR2(150) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    PHONE_NUMBER VARCHAR2(20),
    DATE_OF_BIRTH DATE,
    CUSTOMER_STATUS VARCHAR2(20) NOT NULL,
    CREATED_AT TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
    UPDATED_AT TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP NOT NULL
);
```

The table was verified successfully in Oracle.

