## 13. Customer Repository

A repository was created:

```text
customer/repository/CustomerRepository.java
```

The repository extends:

```java
JpaRepository<Customer, Long>
```

`Customer` represents the entity managed by the repository.

`Long` represents the Java type of the Customer primary key.

Spring Data JPA creates the repository implementation automatically at runtime.

The application therefore does not need to manually implement common persistence operations.

