## 14. Customer Service

A service layer was created:

```text
customer/service/CustomerService.java
```

The Customer Service sits between the REST controller and repository.

Current methods include:

```java
getAllCustomers()
getCustomerById()
```

The service communicates with `CustomerRepository` instead of communicating directly with Hibernate or Oracle.

This gives the application the following separation:

```text
Controller
    ↓
Business/Application Logic
    ↓
Service
    ↓
Persistence Access
    ↓
Repository
```

Future customer business rules will be implemented primarily in the service layer.

