## 21. Application Configuration

The Customer Service contains its own:

```text
application.properties
```

The service contains configuration for:

- Application name
- Server port
- Actuator
- Oracle datasource
- Oracle JDBC driver
- Hibernate schema behavior
- SQL logging

Hibernate schema generation is disabled:

```properties
